@startuml methode-docker-compose
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
title Methode 1 - Docker Compose (dev / petit deploiement)

actor Dev as "Developpeur"

node "Machine hote Linux" as Host {
  package "docker compose" as Compose {
    frame "mutuelle-db" as CDB {
      database "MySQL\n3307 vers 3306" as MySQL
      storage "volume mysql_data" as Vol
    }

    frame "mutuelle-api" as CAPI {
      component "Spring Boot\n8081 vers 8080" as Spring
    }

    frame "mutuelle-adminer" as CAdmin {
      component "Adminer\n8082 vers 8080" as Adminer
    }
  }

  component "Vite dev server\n5173" as Vite
}

Dev --> Vite : http://IP:5173
Dev --> Adminer : http://IP:8082
Vite --> Spring : proxy /api
Spring --> MySQL : DB_HOST=db

note bottom of Compose
  Backend_Mutuelle/docker-compose.yml
  Backend_Mutuelle/.env
  Dockerfile multi-stage Maven + JRE 21
end note

@enduml
